--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn: IEA-15MW UMaine VolturnUS-S -- MIXED deck (3 mooring chains + 1 touchdown power cable)
This aggregate deck works as an OpenFAST MooringFile and as a CableDyn_driver static-initialisation example.
Demonstrates CompMooring=5 carrying an EI=0 catenary mooring AND a finite-EI Hermite lazy-wave
cable behind one deck. Line 4 terminates on the 200 m seabed and exercises coupled finite-EI
normal contact, contact damping, and friction through the OpenFAST aggregate.
